        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CBN100SS4, Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in a wide range of lengths, the 1 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The First Impressions CBN100 Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in clear or frosted acrylic with brushed or polished stainless steel brackets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CBN100SS4 Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PCF03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262329\"><b>First Impressions CBN100SS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>CBN100018SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN100024SS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN100036SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN100048SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\" VALIGN=\"top\" >\r\n<b>CBN100060SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 60\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 48\" </li>\r\n<li>Third Mount is Centered</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN100072SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Third Mount is Centered</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>CBN100084SS4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Third Mount is Centered</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.49\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts",
                "description": "Available in a wide range of lengths, the 1 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Mounts can be mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting. The First Impressions CBN100 Acrylic Door Pull with Stainless Steel Brackets is available in clear or frosted acrylic with brushed or polished stainless steel brackets. \r\n",
